print()
print('To find the constraints generated by the atmospheric abundance observations of a polluted white dwarf you will need to create the following input files:')
print()
print('DataCompositions.csv, DataTimescales.csv, and DataStellar.csv and you will need to adjust lines 45, 50, and 55 of this code to the locations of the files')
print()
print()
print('DataCompositions.csv should have the following data in each column: log(Al/HorHe), error log(Al/HorHe), log(Ti/HorHe), error log(Ti/HorHe), log(Ca/HorHe), error log(Ca/HorHe),')
print('log(Ni/HorHe), error log(Ni/HorHe), log(Fe/HorHe), error log(Fe/HorHe), log(Cr/HorHe), error log(Cr/HorHe), log(Mg/HorHe), error log(Mg/HorHe),')
