print()
print('Each separate white dwarf system should be on a new line in the input files')
print()
print('To start the code type PWDCode([Starting row in input file], [The row after the final row in input file],["True" or "False"])')
print()
print('If an abundance or the uncertainty of an abundance does not exist input 0 for both the abundance and error entries (this code cannot use upper or lower limits).')
print()
